[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 480.309, "timestamp": "00:08:00", "text": "你生病了吗？ 我是。 我不知道。 我的意思是，我一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 483.909, "timestamp": "00:08:03", "text": "开始想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 488.869, "timestamp": "00:08:08", "text": "在早上做 Sammy 的那些事，但是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 493.029, "timestamp": "00:08:13", "text": "我碰巧想到了一些事情，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 496.629, "timestamp": "00:08:16", "text": "这让我有点，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 499.67, "timestamp": "00:08:19", "text": "嗯，就像我醒得很早一样。 好吧，我醒得很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 504.23, "timestamp": "00:08:24", "text": "早。 我在回顾一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 508.469, "timestamp": "00:08:28", "text": "过去的事情。 我偶然间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 512.87, "timestamp": "00:08:32", "text": "看到了一些以前的推文，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 515.43, "timestamp": "00:08:35", "text": "这让我有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 517.43, "timestamp": "00:08:37", "text": "沮丧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 520.55, "timestamp": "00:08:40", "text": "呃，这让我又重新翻看了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 525.11, "timestamp": "00:08:45", "text": "以前所有的事情。 呃，我当时心情有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 529.03, "timestamp": "00:08:49", "text": "低落。 我当时就想，我为什么要那么做呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 531.829, "timestamp": "00:08:51", "text": "？ 所以我就像是凭感觉在听音乐一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 533.91, "timestamp": "00:08:53", "text": "。 我当时就想，“好吧，你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 535.91, "timestamp": "00:08:55", "text": "吗？我今天早上不直播了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 537.99, "timestamp": "00:08:57", "text": "。” 这就是我为什么"}]